 - All of the Prometheus libraries that Ilya Khaprov ([@deadtrickster](https://github.com/deadtrickster)) maintains
 - The logo for the project is an edited version of an SVG image from the [unDraw project](https://undraw.co/)
 - Juan Luis Baptiste for the nifty ApacheBench+Gnuplot shell scripts [apachebench-graphs](https://github.com/juanluisbaptiste/apachebench-graphs)
+
+### Selecting metric storage
+
+Peep is available without the Prometheus Core dependency. If
+`telemetry_metrics_prometheus_core` is installed, the default remains
+`PromEx.Storage.Core`; otherwise the default is `PromEx.Storage.Peep`.
+The `:storage_adapter` configuration still selects an adapter explicitly.
+Applications relying on the Core adapter must add
+`{:telemetry_metrics_prometheus_core, "~> 1.2"}` to their own dependencies.
